  "question": {
    "text": "An ellipse, with foci at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math> and minor axis of length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> , passes through which of the following points?"
